# Gnawing Crescendo: "Whenever a nontoken creature you control dies this turn, create a 1/1 black Rat creature token with 'This
# token can't block.'" (CR 603.7, 700.4). On turn 3 Bot1 casts it, then Lightning Bolts Bot2's Ornithopter (not a creature Bot1
# controls: no Rat), then its own Memnite and Ornithopter: a Rat for each of those two, so two Rats.

